  "description": "There are those that like quality, nice cruisers. We, too, like quality nice cruisers. Cruisers we care about. Cruisers made of aluminum. Cruisers with internal hubs, and cruisers that even people that care about cruisers are impressed by. And the Shoreliner is that very cruiser. Lightweight, rust-proof alloy that's built to last complements its classic aesthetic and irrefutable, easygoing simplicity. Live life the cruiser way, the Shoreliner way.\nLightweight alloy frame and wheels keep the weight down--your back will thank you\nPedal-forward positioning allows for full leg extension while keeping it easy to put a foot down at a stop sign\nDurable Shimano Nexus 3-speed internally geared hub and Revo twist shifter make for maintenance-free shifting simplicity\nCoaster brake creates kickback braking and long-term durability",
